WEBVTT

00:08:57.533 --> 00:09:00.578
And if this sounds like a pie
in the sky idea right now,

00:09:00.619 --> 00:09:03.205
think about Lord Keynes'
mustache for a second

00:09:03.247 --> 00:09:06.083
and consider whether
it's your expectations

00:09:06.083 --> 00:09:07.793
that may need changing.

00:09:08.085 --> 00:09:09.253
Thank you.

00:09:09.253 --> 00:09:12.172
(Applause)